   "subject": "About bench effect",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Group,<div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">I have following questions about removing <span>batch</span> effect by using methylKit (command assocComp and removeComp).</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">1. From the example (<a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/manuals/methylKit/man/methylKit.pdf\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/manuals/methylKit/man/methylKit.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231792420000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cpi_GayExHZkxgHV8FqK0\">https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/manuals/methylKit/man/methylKit.pdf</a>), batch_id and age were used for sampleAnnotation. </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">I wonder can I use sampleAnnotation with only batch_id (or at least two parameter?). </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">2. When I conducted assocComp with 30 samples (15 control, 15 test), I got 30 PCs. </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Is it normal to get the same number of PC as sample?</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">3. After I conducted assocComp, I got $pcs, $vars, and $associations. I read explanation of them from here (<a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/manuals/methylKit/man/methylKit.pdf\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/manuals/methylKit/man/methylKit.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231792420000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cpi_GayExHZkxgHV8FqK0\">https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/manuals/methylKit/man/methylKit.pdf</a>).</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">However,  But I did not understand them. More specifically, I did not understand what PC should be deleted based on what ($vars or $association? with what cut-off?).</div></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Best,</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
