     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Fri, Aug 10, 2018 at 1:04 AM Alice &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mouton...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Altuna,<div>I am following up this discussion:</div><div><br></div><div>$association  matrix has the P-values that comes from a statistical test for association of PCs with sample annotations.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I have 51 parameters (technical and biological covariate) that I want to check. Is the p value corrected for multiple test? <br></div><div>Many thanks</div><div>Alice</div></div></blockquote></div>"
